"Their first trick was with a bunch of colored hankies. They juggled them about and tossed them back and forth. The older magician placed one of the hankies over the palm of his hand. He waved his free hand hypnotically over the top and chanted a strange word, “abracadabra.” He quickly pulled the handkerchief away and voila...a beautiful white dove appeared perched on his finger. Everyone was in awe.": "28d6861d56fa",
