"“About two weeks, I should think,” the teacher told her.": "47da41e5397a",
"“Child labor,” Joe snickered. “Hey, boys! Could you come to the living room please? I have a surprise for you.”": "13ec98d05f65",
"“Don’t worry. I’ll remind you,” Susan said in an attempt to calm her daughter. She knew, though, that Sophia would be asking every day whether her sheep was ready or not. Maybe even twice a day! Until Sophia’s clay sheep was sitting on here dresser in her bedroom, there would be no peace at home.": "ef5ca9303700",
"“God!” Jean cried. “We have company coming for dinner and the living room is a disaster.”": "20c6f1626271",
